  charType: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2718c5863d8c65a4aa712d078446307f, type: 2}
  lineTexts:
  - "There you are, you found me!\t"
  - Did you already find some of those mushrooms? I've heard you pigs are great at
    finding those!
  - They really help against hunger, and the only other thing that matters in life
    is sleep. But these haystacks scattered throughout the forest should also meet
    your urban needs!
  - Speaking of Mushrooms, you don't mind bringing me some of those Shaggy Ink Caps.
    You will find those in open terrain!
